            <ArticleTitle>Effects of pravastatin in heart transplant recipients: implications of Kobashigawa et al.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>341-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The recently published article by Kobashigawa et al. [1] regarding the benefit of using pravastatin in treating hypercholesterolemia in heart transplant recipients is reviewed. A comment on the implications of the researchers' findings follows.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
